                <pb facs="0350" n="270" xml:id="pg270"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Conger</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-10-10"><hi rendition="#italic">October 10,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay directs Mr. Conger to convey to Chinese Government, on the occason of
                    the death of Viceroy Liu K’un-yi, the assurance of the sincere sympathy of the
                    Government of the United States.)</p>
            </div>
